# NOTE: Drug routes, drug dose units, drug order frequencies, individual drug UUIDs,
# service-request category (order type) UUIDs, and the concept UUIDs below (durations,
# lab/radiology/procedure concepts, vitals, H&E, OG, allergy, condition, and coded-value
# concepts) are intentionally NOT hardcoded here. Their values are environment-specific
# and were found to be stale/mismatched for this server; openmrs-setup.ts resolves each
# of these dynamically from the live server on every run when the corresponding env keys
# are absent (see setupOrderTypes, setupConcepts, setupDrugs, setupOrderFrequencies,
# setupDrugRoutes, setupDrugOrderConcepts).
